6,Abai Sungai in Malaysia Profile - joshuaproject.net,https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/print/10120/MY,"The Abai Sungai need a clear and faithful witness to the gospel of Jesus Christ. Since they are part of a Muslim community with additional traditional beliefs, their need is not simply exposure to religion but understanding the difference between external religious practice and true faith in Christ.",Abai Sungai,Austronesian
